  ('c8ce211b-348a-4de9-a30d-2eaa2a1004c8', 3, null, 'Pull the beef apart into loose pieces and add it to the pan. Simmer, stirring gently and skimming off any foam, until no pink remains and it reaches 145°F, 3–4 minutes.', 240, null, 62.8),
