  ('22f45715-5972-4f72-bc9c-c8f1e1874029', 1, 'Fish', '2 lb red snapper or sea bass, skin on, cut crosswise into 1½-inch-thick pieces', 'red snapper or sea bass', 2, 'lb', 'skin on, cut crosswise into 1½-inch-thick pieces', false),
